OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opened after 18-year-old
OL,4,Awoman's crash death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has been opened into the
OL,7,Fdeath of an 18-year-old woman who died
OL,8,Ffollowing a crash in Oxfordshire.
OL,10,FEsme Heaton-Biggs's white Volkswagen
OL,11,FPolo and a white Mercedes were involved
OL,12,Fin a collision on Bloxham Road,
OL,13,FBanbury, on 3 October. She died later
OL,14,Fin hospital.
OL,16,FOxford Coroner's Court heard her
OL,17,Fmedical cause of death "remains under
OL,18,Finvestigation". A full inquest is set
OL,19,Fto take place on 12 April 2027.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
